	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella has already taken down around ten spiders by now, but more are pouring in from the elevator doors.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("We’re running out of ammo and have no choice but to back up, drawing close together.")
	novel_interface.show_character("russell")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Our outfits are all made of waterproof fiber. Where do we find fabric that can absorb liquid? We gotta strip to our underwear or something?","Russel")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","perspire1")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("H-hey, try this!","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I toss my “small emergency pack” to Cassel before turning around and running for the hills.")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Hm? What’s this?","Cassel")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("F-series... pack of 18... high breathability, no fluorescent agent...","Cassel")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","shy")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Stop reading it out loud!","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Menstruation period... for sensitive skin... 250-mm long...\nCan it be...","Cassel")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","shy_left")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("C’mon, idiot, don’t read it out loud!","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	novel_interface.show_character("fabiola_battle","mock")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Ah, I see what it is. It’s perfect.","Fabella")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella sends me a meaningful glance.")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Ooh, this is wonderful!\nIt even puffs up a little after absorbing water. It’ll seal the bottle up just right!","Cassel")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","sob")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Do you really have to go into detail? Come on...)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Soon, Cassel reappears from behind the rack with his newly created Molotov cocktails.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Following Fabella’s orders, we keep Cassel covered as we all move as one to the elevator.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("He tosses a few Molotov cocktails and the entrance to the elevator goes up in flames.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("We take out the rest of the spiders with our remaining ammo and melee weapons.")
	novel_interface.show_character("russell")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("We should be okay for now...","Russel")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Russel has several scratch marks on his elbow, and Cassel’s got a wound in one leg.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella finally calms down a bit after the chaotic battle. She approaches me and pats me silently on the back.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","shy")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(W-what does she mean by that?)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(And why is she smiling like she knows something?)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I have only two bullets left in my magazine.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Though we’re safe for now, I really don’t have any useful items left.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","upset")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Maybe in the, uh, last round, I... died here?)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I stare anxiously at the orange flames devouring the elevator entrance, and wonder...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Just what’s the point of this groundhog day situation?")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("No matter how many times I repeat this experience... how many new gadgets I bring with me...")
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I’ll still die again and again?")
	novel_interface.show_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/Hospital_Passage.png")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
	novel_interface.show_character("liliu_research","normal")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("What you gotta do is to find key information in the target’s memories. Don’t leave any stone unturned.","Mariru")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("The target is currently high on the coma scale. We don’t know much about her past, so we’re not sure what part of her memory she’s currently stuck in.","Mariru")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	novel_interface.show_character("ai","blush_stare")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Which means you gotta pay attention to every detail... even if your target’s in the shower!","Aya")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Wait. When did this conversation happen? In the hospital? In the SID headquarters?")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("My memory is getting all blurry...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("What was that “key information” Mariru mentioned?")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Did she even mention this term at all?")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Miss Ren...","Skuld")
	novel_interface.show_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/Factory.png")
	novel_interface.show_character("skuld","normal")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Miss Ren!","Skuld")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Skuld tugging me on the sleeve brings me back to reality.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","gratified")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Hmm?","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	novel_interface.show_character("skuld","normal")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("That thing you gave Cassel... What’s that?","Skuld")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Skuld asks, studying the square-shaped bag in her hands with pure, innocent eyes.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","shy")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Uh... it’s...","Ren")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Heaven help me! Don’t ask me this in front of everyone!)","Ren")
	novel_interface.change_expression("smile")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("You’re... you’re not old enough for that, haha.","Ren")
	novel_interface.change_expression("wry_smile")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(I’m not that experienced in using it either...)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I awkwardly try to change the subject. I really don’t want to explain something like this to a little girl this young...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Wait. A little girl this young...")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","upset")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(The first time I met Skuld, she was only slightly older than Elluka.)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But this memory should be from two years ago. Girls at this age usually change a lot in two years.")
	novel_interface.show_character("skuld","normal")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But this Skuld I see in front of me looks the exact same as the one I saw in the hospital.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Her outfit, hair style, height, face, even the faint milky smell in her hair... exactly the same.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Did I... “construct” her according to my own memories?")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella used to be a special force squad leader under Ritnalap, intelligence organization in the Second Academy City.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But she later became a maid-slash-bodyguard for Skuld.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("If this were the first time they met.. what exactly happened here?")
	novel_interface.show_character("russell")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Hey, those bugs are pouring in from the roof!","Russel")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Russel suddenly yells, pointing at the ceiling.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Several small robot spiders have scuttled in from the air vent above the warehouse.")
	novel_interface.show_character("fabiola_battle","angry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Ugh, I hate bugs!","Fabella")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I continue staring at this “Skuld” and do not even bother to pick up a melee weapon for our last stand.")
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(I keep bringing new items I need into this world...)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("But the one who’s actually in charge of keeping that “information with a will” at bay is Fabella herself.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The key to turning the tide had already appeared before the first robot spider even did, right?")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("That item... it seemed to be demanding my attention, urging me to touch it...")
	novel_interface.show_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/Factory.png")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","solemn")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Skuld, let me borrow this for a bit.","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I take the black crocodile-skin folder from Skuld and pull out the faded ancient manuscript.")
	await novel_interface.stop_music()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The second my hand touches the paper, the text and patterns on it twist and morph into something completely incomprehensible.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("If I observe carefully, I can actually distinguish every rune. But put them all together and I can’t understand a thing.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","solemn")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(Just like the first time I met Elluka...)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("(This manuscript must be a page from a Grimoire...)","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The small spiders come hopping down from the ceiling and crawling towards us. The squad members begin whacking at them with steel poles and crowbars.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I pull Fabella aside amidst all the chaos.")
	novel_interface.show_character("fabiola_battle","angry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Hey! What do you think you’re doing?","Fabella")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I simply grab her hand and place it into Skuld’s.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_mercenary","solemn")
	novel_interface.change_music("res://assets/audio/music/Witch's Confession.mp3")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("I can’t really explain now, but you’ll get it in no time—","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Because this belongs to you. It’s your Grimoire.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("You made the choice to let it possess you two years ago, the first time you met Skuld.")

	# 重要的结局部分
	novel_interface.change_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/FactoryLF.png")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I stuff the manuscript into Fabella’s hand. The very next second, the faded paper transforms into a beam of blinding light.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("A gigantic flaming sphere pops up in the middle of the warehouse and slowly drifts down like some kind of apparition.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The sphere gradually decreases in size as it descends, and disappears into Fabella’s body, becoming part of her...")
	novel_interface.change_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/Factory.png")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("A layer of lively flames are wrapped around Fabella’s arm—yet I don’t feel any heat, even though my hand is holding hers.")
	novel_interface.show_character("skuld","worry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Fire... magic...","Skuld")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Suddenly, a small robot leaps up and pounces on Skuld.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella reflexively punches it squarely on the body. In less than a second, the black robot spider is devoured by a ball of flames.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("It shatters into countless tiny components, which all burn to ashes before they even hit the ground.")
	novel_interface.show_character("fabiola_battle","panic")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("What’s this...?","Fabella")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Fabella stares at the flames on her hands in confusion. They spread outward, forming a barrier around her.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Any spider that dares approach its periphery spontaneously combusts.")
	novel_interface.change_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/FactoryL.png")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The flaming barrier continues expanding in range, like a 2D picture being burned in a 3D space.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("All remaining space in the warehouse seems to be gleaming in an eerie white light, as if ignited by flames coming from an even higher plane.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("That’s when all the small spiders seem to evaporate—")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("And the warehouse walls evaporate with them too.")
	await novel_interface.stop_music()
	novel_interface.show_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/white_bg.png")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I have a headache.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("A really serious headache.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("Feels like a sack of cement in my brain, and someone’s stirring it. Feels familiar...")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("…")
	novel_interface.show_background("res://assets/images/bg/Fabiola/Dementium.png")
	novel_interface.change_music("res://assets/audio/music/Shop.mp3")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I open my eyes to an arc-shaped object over my head. I recognize it as Harima Tech’s brain-hacking device.")
	novel_interface.show_character("ren_maid","upset")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("How much time has passed...?","Ren")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I rub my eyes and get up, yawning as I look around the room. The city is still sleeping outside the window.")
