	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I twist my head to look at the hospital bed beside mine. The blond girl is sleeping face-down, drooling over the sheets.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I can’t see Fabella’s expression as the equipment is in the way, but I can see her hand gently carding through Skuld’s soft hair.")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("I try to wriggle my arms a bit. I seem to have had a really complicated dream. My brain doesn’t feel well-rested at all.")
